@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About · Starter</PageTitle>

<KlyPageHeader Headline="About" Title="How this app is put together" Description="Three small projects share one set of pages." />

<KlyContainer Class="pb-16">
    <KlyPageBody>
        <p>
            The pages, the layout and the styles live in <code>Starter.Shared</code>, a Razor class library. <code>Starter.Web</code> hosts them
            on the web with global interactivity (server first, then WebAssembly from <code>Starter.Web.Client</code>), and <code>Starter.Maui</code>
            hosts the same pages in a native app.
        </p>
        <h2>Where to start</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><code>Pages/Home.razor</code> is this app's home page: replace it.</li>
            <li><code>Layout/MainLayout.razor</code> holds the header, the footer and the navigation.</li>
            <li><code>StarterServices.cs</code> configures Klyroo for every host in one place.</li>
            <li><code>Styles/app.css</code> is your Tailwind entry point, compiled by the build.</li>
        </ul>
    </KlyPageBody>
</KlyContainer>
